Task 1: Hospital Patient Management System Using Paging
Scenario
A multi-specialty hospital stores thousands of patient records. The receptionist wants to view
patient details page by page instead of loading all records at once.
Requirements
Entity: Patient
Variables
• patientId
• patientName
• disease
• age
Classes
• Patient
• PatientRepository
• PatientService
• PatientServiceImpl
• AppConfig
• MainClass
Instructions
1. Create Patient entity.
2. Create PatientRepository extending PagingAndSortingRepository.
3. Insert at least 15 patient records.
4. Accept page number and page size.
5. Display patients page-wise.
6. Show:
• Current Page
• Total Pages
• Total Records
Expected Operations
• View Page 1
• View Page 2
• View Page 3
